<Legal title="Terms of service | Bridge" description="Terms of service for Bridge, a non-medical appointment service in Lincoln and Omaha, Nebraska." heading="Terms of service">

        <p class="mt-3 text-base">Effective date: <strong><Ph>new effective date, set on publish</Ph></strong></p>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-line bg-green-tint p-5">
          <p><strong>Plain-English summary:</strong> Bridge provides non-medical appointment execution support in Lincoln and Omaha, NE. We help independent older adults get to, through, and home from medical appointments. <strong>We are not a medical provider.</strong> If there is an emergency, call 911.</p>
